      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dealloying, compositional instability, and internal stress under reducing conditions predispose the alloy to catastrophic failure.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to the starting baseline, oxidizing exposure will increase grain-boundary oxide formation.",
